[7:27AM]
#GbagadaExpress
#RoadIncident
A loaded truck reportedly overturned at the Gbagada Ramp Bridge inward Anthony, completely obstructing the roadway.
Recovery operations are currently ongoing.

Motorists are advised to avoid this  route and use alternative routes as no vehicular access for now. 

Traffic Advisory / Alternative Route:
All vehicular movement from Northwest Filling Station toward Eternal Filling Station should divert left inward Gbagada Mini Stadium and connect Gbagada Ramp (Seller side) upward to Anthony.
